# The five stock gUFO temporary-situation classes are covered explicitly, not omitted.
# logic: replaces each reifier with logic:Fluent plus RDF 1.2 edge properties, and the
# current gUFO lowering deliberately does not reconstruct the old node. The semantic
# association is therefore relatedMatch while the executable preservation is Unsupported.

